OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged after jewellery
OL,4,Astore raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged with robbery
OL,7,Ffollowing a raid at a Peterborough
OL,8,Fjewellery store that left a member of
OL,9,Fstaff with life-threatening injuries.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire Police said six men
OL,12,Ftargeted Lala Jewellers on Gladstone
OL,13,FStreet shortly before midday on
OL,14,FSaturday. A 50-year-old employee was
OL,15,Fseriously injured during the incident
OL,16,Fand remains in hospital.
OL,18,FWasim Iqbal, 43 and Subur Ahmed, 20,
OL,19,Fboth from Bradford, were arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of robbery on Tuesday
OL,21,Fmorning, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
