OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged after jewellery
OL,4,Astore raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair have since been charged with
OL,7,Frobbery and possession of criminal
OL,8,Fproperty and are due to appear at
OL,9,FHuntingdon Magistrates' Court on
OL,10,FThursday afternoon.
